# Orcish Bowmasters: "deals 1 damage to ANY target" - it kills Bot2's Llanowar Elves on entering (turn 3, with the Elves'
# 1/1 body) and makes the Orc Army. "Whenever an OPPONENT draws": Bot1's own Ponder draws nothing for it, so there is no
# trigger and the Army stays at one counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Orcish Bowmasters
Ponder
Swamp x3
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x5
Forest x10

